      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A note for anyone having this problem still-\nApparently this also blocks SendCustomNetworkEvent on children of the PlayerManager too.\nI can just name my object \"Player Manager\" instead though it would have been nice to know this. Glad I found this bug report",
      "viewerReactions": null,
